nudro addBig(a, b) {
    plulai res := [];
    plulai i := dra(a) - 1;
    plulai j := dra(b) - 1;
    plulai carry := 0;
    edrushe i >= 0 tobe j >= 0 tobe carry > 0
        plulai s := carry;
        atdoyal (i >= 0) { s := s + a[i]; i := i - 1; }
        atdoyal (j >= 0) { s := s + b[j]; j := j - 1; }
        sutse(res, s % 10);
        carry := s / 10;
    aitudre
    # res is reversed
    plulai out := [];
    plulai k := dra(res) - 1;
    edrushe k >= 0
        sutse(out, res[k]);
        k := k - 1;
    aitudre
    druna out;
}
```
Wait — condition in edrushe must be boolean; `i >= 0 tobe j >= 0 tobe carry > 0` evaluates booleans with tobe — fine.

Edge: 0 + 0: a=[0], b=[0]. Loop: s=0+0+0 → res=[0], carry 0, i=-1,j=-1 → stop. out=[0]. Good. "0" has digits [0].

